splay":"fill"}},"description":"<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Inleiding</strong></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">Wanneer we&nbsp;door&nbsp;de stad lopen zien wij voorbeelden van producten die binnen Ruimte en de gemeente Utrecht gemaakt worden. Die hebben een plek in de stad en dus hebben zij geografie.</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">Verder krijgen we steeds meer vragen vanuit Ruimte, de gemeente, de raad en van burgers met een verzoek voor data en/of deze te combineren met data van bijvoorbeeld de Rijksoverheid of de Provincie.</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">Het in kaart brengen van gegevens en het vastleggen ervan&nbsp;op coördinaten noemen we geo-informatie.</p>\n"},{"title":"Wat is GEO-informatie?","contentActions":[],"creaDate":1665392040157,"status":"PUBLISHED","media":{"type":"webpage","webpage":{"url":"https://gu-geo.maps.arcgis.com/apps/MapJournal/index.html?appid=834aa278ba7740e1b455047dad48f4d4","type":"webpage","altText":"","display":"stretch","unload":true,"useParentOrigin":false}},"description":""},{"title":"Wat hebben we al?","contentActions":[],"creaDate":1665393122141,"status":"PUBLISHED","media":{"type":"webpage","webpage":{"url":"https://gu-geo.maps.arcgis.com/apps/MapJournal/index.html?appid=bab8b2ea17da40e7a8cd7a2dc2c5af7d","type":"webpage","altText":"","display":"stretch","unload":true,"useParentOrigin":false}},"description":""},{"title":"Nieuwe technische kansen","contentActions":[],"creaDate":1665393132822,"status":"PUBLISHED","media":{"type":"webpage","webpage":{"url":"https://gu-geo.maps.arcgis.com/apps/MapJournal/index.html?appid=7327d3c6a7ed4c29b629e83f8405edc0","type":"webpage","altText":"","display":"stretch","unload":true,"useParentOrigin":